<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="konten">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1><%= __("Pencarian") %></h1>
  <form class="search big" action="<%= u('/cari') %>" role="search"><label class="sr" for="q2"><%= __("Kata kunci") %></label><input id="q2" name="q" type="search" value="<%= q %>" maxlength="80" placeholder="<%= __('Cari berita, lini bisnis...') %>"><button class="btn btn-primary"><%= __("Cari") %></button></form></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow-l">
<% const total = posts.length + lines.length + pages.length; %>
<% if (q.length < 2) { %><p class="muted"><%= __("Masukkan minimal 2 karakter.") %></p>
<% } else if (!total) { %><p><%= __('Tidak ada hasil untuk') %> "<strong><%= q %></strong>".</p>
<% } else { %><p class="muted"><%= total %> <%= __('hasil untuk') %> "<%= q %>"</p>
  <ul class="results">
  <% lines.forEach(l => { %><li><span class="chip"><%= __("Lini Bisnis") %></span><a href="<%= u('/lini-bisnis/' + (l.slug)) %>"><%= c(l,'title') %></a><p><%= c(l,'summary') %></p></li><% }) %>
  <% posts.forEach(p => { %><li><span class="chip"><%= __("Berita") %></span><a href="<%= u('/berita/' + (p.slug)) %>"><%= c(p,'title') %></a><p><%= c(p,'excerpt') || U.excerpt(c(p,'body'), 140) %></p></li><% }) %>
  <% pages.forEach(p => { %><li><span class="chip"><%= __("Halaman") %></span><a href="<%= u('/halaman/' + (p.slug)) %>"><%= c(p,'title') %></a></li><% }) %>
  </ul><% } %>
</div></section>
</main>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
